ith a nearby word. A direct relation can still be a false assertion: keep conflict and semantic fit separate.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the medium of \\\"The Man Who Never Was\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 190, \"text\": \"The Man Who Never Was The Man Who Never Was is a 1956 UK Second World War film, produced by André Hakim, directed by Ronald Neame, that stars Clifton Webb, Gloria Grahame and Robert Flemyng.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 191, \"end\": 238, \"text\": \"It is based on the book of the same name by Lt.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 239, \"end\": 244, \"text\": \"Cmdr.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 245, \"end\": 287, \"text\": \"Ewen Montagu and dramatises actual events.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 288, \"end\": 511, \"text\": \"The film's storyline concerns Operation Mincemeat, a 1943 British Intelligence plan to deceive the Axis powers into thinking Operation \\\"Husky\\\", the Allied invasion of Sicily, would take place elsewhere in the Mediterranean.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 512, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"\\\"The Man Who Never Was\\\" was entered into the 1956 Cannes Film Festival.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d00\", \"start\": 584, \"end\": 589, \"text\": \"Nigel\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0017-989c4321a69b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 478, \"text\": \"`` A Little Ignorance '' John Newland Merwin Gerard October 19 , 1966 ( 1966-10-19 ) 1209 8 `` Target : Eva '' Walter Doniger Story by : E